10 REM NEAL-PITTEWAY CIRCLES - LO-RES, SCALED TO INTEGERS
20 REM X=X-E/2*Y : Y=Y+E*X : X=X-E/2*Y, E=1/32, EVERYTHING SCALED BY 1024
30 REM ONE TURN IS 2*PI/E STEPS: S RUNS TO 208 OR EACH RING IS AN OPEN ARC
40 REM A LO-RES CELL IS 7 DOTS WIDE AND 4 TALL, SO A COLUMN IS 1792 NOT 1024
50 GR
60 CALL -936
70 FOR K=1 TO 3
80 COLOR=K*3+3
90 X=K*6144
100 Y=0
110 FOR S=1 TO 208
120 X=X-Y/64
130 Y=Y+X/32
140 X=X-Y/64
150 V=20+(Y+512*SGN(Y))/1024
160 W=20+(X+896*SGN(X))/1792
170 PLOT W,V
180 NEXT S
190 NEXT K
200 END
